{"id":"conv_04555","context":"A uni student interviews a retired civil servant","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Thank you for your time today. I heard you worked for a local government for many years.","jp":"本日はお時間ありがとうございます。長年地方自治体でお勤めだったと伺いました。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,7,8,9,14,21,28,39,56,73,94,111,492,944,3682,4781,5401,6676,11758],"jpTokens":[{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"},{"s":"長年","r":"ながねん","w":3682},{"s":"地方自治体","r":"ちほうじちたい","w":6676},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"お勤め","r":"おつとめ"},{"s":"だっ","w":21},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"伺い","r":"うかがい","w":11758},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Yes, about forty years. I spent my career implementing policies that the assembly had voted on at the local level.","jp":"ええ、四十年ほどね。議会で議決された政策を現場で動かす、そういう仕事を続けてきましたよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[4,5,7,8,14,19,28,35,51,58,68,135,148,161,184,187,330,518,548,1039,1274,2078,3039,3816,4693,4781,6684,13037,17752],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"四","r":"よん","w":330},{"s":"十","r":"じゅう","w":135},{"s":"年","r":"ねん","w":35},{"s":"ほど","w":187},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"},{"s":"議会","r":"ぎかい","w":2078},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"議決","r":"ぎけつ","w":6684},{"s":"さ","w":19},{"s":"れ","w":58},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"政策","r":"せいさく","w":548},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"現場","r":"げんば","w":1039},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"動かす","r":"うごかす","w":4693},{"s":"、"},{"s":"そういう","w":148},{"s":"仕事","r":"しごと","w":161},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"続け","r":"つづけ","w":1274},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"き","w":184},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Were you also involved in the election of mayors or the appointment of advisory council members?","jp":"首長の選出