40,3839,5964,6664,10924],"jpTokens":[{"s":"批判","r":"ひはん","w":940},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"立場","r":"たちば","w":763},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"不利","r":"ふり","w":6664},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"なる","w":47},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"なかっ","w":13},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Of course it did. But because every step I took was legally sound, in the end I could stand by my decisions.","jp":"もちろんあったよ。ただ、すべて合法的な手続きを踏んでいたから、最後は筋を通せた。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,5,7,8,18,20,21,22,34,68,247,305,309,335,2671,2701,4487,6719,7202,7550,11283,12475],"jpTokens":[{"s":"もちろん","w":335},{"s":"あっ","w":22},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"ただ","w":247},{"s":"、"},{"s":"すべて","w":309},{"s":"合法","r":"ごうほう","w":6719},{"s":"的","r":"てき","w":34},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"手続き","r":"てつづき","w":2701},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"踏ん","r":"ふん","w":12475},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"、"},{"s":"最後","r":"さいご","w":305},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"筋","r":"すじ","w":2671},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"通せ","r":"とおせ"},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I see. Is there anything you would like to convey to today's young public servants?","jp":"なるほど。今の若い職員に伝えたいことはありますか?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,14,15,16,22,39,62,87,1055,1289,1442,2391,2724,3280,5964,9114,12599],"jpTokens":[{"s":"なるほど","w":3280},{"s":"。"},{"s":"今","r":"いま","w":87},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"若い","r":"わかい","w":1055},{"s":"職員","r":"しょくいん","w":1442},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"伝え","r":"つたえ","w":2724},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"あり","w":22},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Listen to residents. That is the whole of it. Procedural correctness alone will never earn you genuine public trust.","jp":"住民の声を聞くこと。それに尽きるね。手続きの正しさだけでは、本当の信頼は得られないから。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":fa